# Nothing here is uploaded to the site. The blog's Markdown sources live beside
# their rendered pages so a post is one self-contained folder, but the .md is
# the input to `npm run blog`, not a page: publishing it would also expose any
# post still marked `draft: true` at a guessable URL.
*.md

# Whole folders for posts still marked `draft: true`, so their screenshots are
# not fetchable either. Managed by `npm run blog`, do not edit by hand.
# drafts:start
# drafts:end
